WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:06.860
Lost promises to the stars

00:06.900 --> 00:13.100
Memories never fade.

00:22.650 --> 00:26.280
While searching for four-leaf clovers

00:26.320 --> 00:30.520
I steal a glance at your face

00:30.560 --> 00:34.020
And then quickly look away

00:34.400 --> 00:39.360
A gentle rain falls over us

00:39.400 --> 00:42.200
As we meet more people

00:42.240 --> 00:45.230
The more dramatic it gets

00:45.270 --> 00:50.800
Will the day come when we find

00:50.850 --> 00:56.750
Our broken treasures again?

00:56.850 --> 01:02.290
The scars will not fade

01:02.320 --> 01:08.130
We each must go

01:08.160 --> 01:12.220
To where we belong

01:33.990 --> 01:38.980
It's been weird lately. I feel like
I'm not here even though I am.

01:42.460 --> 01:46.200
There was supposed to be
lots of things I could do,

01:46.230 --> 01:50.330
things I need to do,
things I need to worry about...

01:54.410 --> 01:56.340
M-My nose hurts.

01:57.080 --> 01:59.440
Is my head feeling fuzzy

01:59.480 --> 02:02.580
because of the hay fever
I got this year?

02:03.720 --> 02:06.520
The scenery is fuzzy because of
my tears and runny nose.

02:07.860 --> 02:09.020
Before I knew it,

02:09.060 --> 02:11.960
I started repeatedly thinking
about the past.

02:13.230 --> 02:16.930
The cherry blossoms keep on
passing before of my eyes.

02:17.730 --> 02:21.670
I feel as if I'm rewinding
the same video.

02:26.170 --> 02:29.200
Over and over, over and over...

02:45.890 --> 02:47.990
I wonder if Professor Tange's okay...

02:48.400 --> 02:49.830
He's gotten old...

02:49.860 --> 02:52.200
from getting involved with
the likes of Shinobu...

02:52.570 --> 02:54.400
Is he going to repeat
a year this year, too?

02:54.640 --> 02:57.370
I'm finally in the same year
as Shinobu.

02:57.540 --> 03:00.700
The legendary eighth-year student
is born at last. huh?

03:01.240 --> 03:02.230
So...

03:02.280 --> 03:04.970
Where's the person responsible for
making Professor Tange like this?!

03:05.510 --> 03:07.670
Why isn't he pouring sake for him?

03:08.780 --> 03:09.770
What?

03:11.090 --> 03:12.070
This is...

03:13.350 --> 03:15.290
Sh-Shinobu.

03:19.630 --> 03:20.920
Shi-no-bu!

03:24.170 --> 03:25.330
Shi-no-bu!

03:25.630 --> 03:29.570
Going home on the last train.

03:29.870 --> 03:33.030
The red lanterns beneath
the overpass always approach.

03:33.070 --> 03:34.870
- He's gone to a group of total strangers...

03:34.910 --> 03:37.340
- while singing naturally...
- Her braided hair

03:37.380 --> 03:38.680
is swaying.
- Furthermore, they look like

03:38.710 --> 03:39.940
- they were waiting for him.
- That girl's

03:39.980 --> 03:41.640
- He's placed speakers and spotlights
- name is

03:41.680 --> 03:43.620
- and he even made his own flyers.
- Daigoro.

03:43.890 --> 03:45.380
- He couldn't even turn in
- The sake

03:45.420 --> 03:47.680
- his graduation project on time.
- poured in silence.

03:48.020 --> 03:49.920
The sake served in a tumbler

03:49.960 --> 03:52.590
- satisfies even the blood.
- He's at it again this year, too, huh?

03:53.060 --> 03:55.760
This is the fifth time
I've seen this giant recital.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.460
- Oh. Takumi.
- Shi-no-bu!

03:57.730 --> 03:59.060
Here's some refreshments.

04:00.440 --> 04:01.600
Shi-no-bu!

04:04.270 --> 04:06.040
Takumi, what happened to
flower-viewing with your company?

04:06.410 --> 04:07.810
I heard you were placed
in charge of the flower-viewing.

04:08.440 --> 04:09.600
It was yesterday,

04:10.380 --> 04:12.370
but got switched to
a mahjongg tournament due to the rain.

04:12.950 --> 04:14.310
I was surprised.

04:14.450 --> 04:16.880
I was saving a spot,
and then, it suddenly started pouring.

04:17.990 --> 04:19.510
Right. I understand.

04:19.820 --> 04:21.880
Then it'll be changed to
a mahjongg tournament.

04:22.590 --> 04:24.220
I'll make reservations at Tachikawa.

04:25.860 --> 04:26.990
Yes, okay.

04:28.300 --> 04:30.530
Now then, I guess I'll head back.

04:52.290 --> 04:54.480
Takumi... Takumi...

04:55.160 --> 04:58.280
What's distracting you?
Here. have a drink.

04:58.460 --> 05:00.790
Huh? Oh, thank you.

05:02.200 --> 05:04.160
There's a petal in your cup.

05:06.070 --> 05:09.660
Ooh. I see... Flower and all. huh?

05:10.640 --> 05:12.200
Then, I'd better get going...

05:12.940 --> 05:15.640
It's almost time for
the shopping district toast,

05:15.680 --> 05:16.670
so I have to go.

05:17.280 --> 05:19.610
Hey, Ayu, we're starting!

05:19.780 --> 05:22.550
Now then. here's to
the continued expansion

05:22.580 --> 05:24.110
of the Hamadayama shopping district!

05:24.420 --> 05:25.680
Cheers!

05:25.720 --> 05:27.210
Cheers!

05:31.730 --> 05:34.490
Hmm. so that's Takumi. huh?

05:35.760 --> 05:37.460
He's wearing such
pretentious glasses...

05:37.800 --> 05:41.100
Man, that Ayu...
She's got awful taste in men!

05:43.070 --> 05:45.540
What's so great about that four-eyes?

05:45.640 --> 05:48.470
Or should I say,
that guy's got awful taste in women!

05:49.610 --> 05:53.380
Here our adorable Miss Ayu
cares for him so much!

05:53.750 --> 05:56.150
He's completely obsessed with
and stalking

05:56.180 --> 05:58.050
a woman who
won't even look at him...

05:58.590 --> 06:01.080
What's he thinking?
It's totally inexcusable!

06:01.520 --> 06:03.620
What a godless extravagant jerk!

06:03.660 --> 06:07.320
Hold on now, gentlemen,
I understand his determination.

06:07.560 --> 06:10.500
Say what, Ippei?
What do you mean by that?!

06:10.730 --> 06:12.500
Listen up.
Take a look, gentlemen!

06:13.870 --> 06:15.730
This endearing sleeping face.

06:15.970 --> 06:18.670
And her beautiful legs!
And her pure heart!

06:19.270 --> 06:22.140
She's hardly changed at all since
she was an elementary school student.

06:23.340 --> 06:25.810
Even if he has been consumed
by a hopeless love...

06:25.850 --> 06:29.180
he was showered with Miss Ayu's
"I love you" lasers,

06:29.220 --> 06:30.910
and didn't even budge!

06:31.890 --> 06:33.620
He didn't take her

06:33.650 --> 06:37.150
even though her loveliness dangled
in front of his nose for four years.

06:37.190 --> 06:41.180
I definitely accept
that four-eyes's determination.

06:41.360 --> 06:44.490
- Ippei!
- You're exactly right, Ippei!

06:44.530 --> 06:46.760
Excellent, president of
the third generation group!

06:46.970 --> 06:48.770
Man, you're quite a guy!

06:49.100 --> 06:50.660
Okay, let's have a toast!

06:51.040 --> 06:53.060
To that four-eyes!

06:54.480 --> 06:55.460
Did you catch a cold?

06:55.710 --> 06:57.010
I feel a bit of a chill...

06:59.350 --> 07:00.910
Gee, can you beat that?

07:00.950 --> 07:03.010
I'm awesome. I'm really popular.

07:03.320 --> 07:05.480
Wow! It's a mountain of tributes!

07:05.590 --> 07:07.820
No way...
It's a pile of fan letters.

07:07.990 --> 07:10.120
I've started to get confused
about this world...

07:10.630 --> 07:13.530
Japan is finished if a person like this
is made out to be a hero.

07:13.900 --> 07:17.160
Oh. Come to think of it.
where's Mouse #1? I don't see her.

07:18.070 --> 07:21.630
Man, here I was thinking of
letting her wear the Chibi-Hams.

07:22.570 --> 07:24.600
Shinobu.
when you were little,

07:24.640 --> 07:26.570
did you dote too much on
dogs or cats

07:26.610 --> 07:29.100
and give them
nervous breakdowns?

07:31.450 --> 07:34.240
You little! Pee-wee! Adorable!

07:35.450 --> 07:38.150
Ohhh, thief! Pee-wee!

07:42.460 --> 07:43.620
How'd you know?!

07:44.230 --> 07:45.250
- I knew it...
- I knew it...

07:45.960 --> 07:49.190
Come on, what's with you guys?
Enough already.

07:49.430 --> 07:52.800
You'll never get to see
this costume being worn!

07:56.400 --> 07:58.340
Hagu, I'm hungry.

07:58.940 --> 08:01.070
Could you let us have
the boxed meal?

08:02.280 --> 08:03.270
Okay...

08:04.650 --> 08:08.050
Oh. how beautiful.
Rainbow rice balls. huh?

08:09.250 --> 08:11.010
Whoa, this green rice ball.

08:11.050 --> 08:12.710
I thought it was perilla leaf,
but it's mint?!

08:13.020 --> 08:14.010
This tastes terri...

08:15.420 --> 08:20.830
Yeah. Delicious.
Hagu, it's really tasty.

08:22.360 --> 08:25.920
Yeah. delicious.
Could you give me one more?

08:27.130 --> 08:28.120
Okay.

08:28.940 --> 08:31.340
Hagu hasn't been herself lately.

08:32.310 --> 08:34.970
She's been like this ever since
she went out with Shinobu.

08:35.980 --> 08:38.780
I don't know what
happened between them.

08:39.550 --> 08:44.990
But I don't see the little bird broach
on her chest that often.

08:45.850 --> 08:48.910
Has Shinobu noticed that?

08:49.420 --> 08:52.090
Or has he not noticed?

08:57.900 --> 08:59.890
Hanamoto Sensei, where's Hagu?

09:00.270 --> 09:05.830
Oh, she's out buying lunch.
But she should've been back by now.

09:06.470 --> 09:08.100
I wonder if the lunch place is crowded.

09:08.510 --> 09:10.030
Shall I go check things out?

09:10.480 --> 09:11.470
Yeah.

09:11.550 --> 09:12.540
In that case, I'm counting on you.

09:12.580 --> 09:13.570
Okay.

09:31.830 --> 09:32.820
I found you.

09:33.400 --> 09:37.000
You Hagu-baby. Chibi-Hams,
it's been a while. eh?

09:37.140 --> 09:39.300
How're you?
I see. I see.

09:39.510 --> 09:42.640
Come on, say something.
You want some sunflower seeds?!

09:43.210 --> 09:46.150
You're not yourself.
It's cold today.

09:46.910 --> 09:48.440
I know.
You can have this.

09:50.750 --> 09:52.810
There. Mouse roll.

10:30.120 --> 10:33.620
Oh. there she is.
Hagu!

10:34.060 --> 10:35.620
Hey...
What?

10:35.960 --> 10:39.190
Hey. What's wrong?!
Hagu!

10:40.500 --> 10:42.590
Oh, no. She's got a terrible fever.

10:43.040 --> 10:47.500
S-Sensei, Hagu...
Hagu's in trouble!

10:47.780 --> 10:49.540
Hagu's in trouble!

11:03.490 --> 11:04.980
I like cherry blossoms.

11:08.430 --> 11:12.420
I don't know why,
but I feel relieved when they fall.

11:13.900 --> 11:15.870
It might be because

11:15.900 --> 11:19.270
I'm released from the sadness
of waiting for their disappearance.

11:28.920 --> 11:31.320
Well, it seems like you got
quite a warm reception.

11:32.720 --> 11:36.050
They're all new student flyers...

11:36.290 --> 11:37.380
- Hey, you.
- Hey, you.

11:37.430 --> 11:39.420
- How about joining the tennis club?
- It's all about easy listening, right?

11:39.460 --> 11:42.160
- How about it? Join us!
- It'll be really great!

11:43.630 --> 11:46.360
I'm a senior now, though...

11:47.670 --> 11:50.640
Y-Yuta, you want some coffee?!

11:53.940 --> 11:55.810
Sensei, how's Hagu?

11:56.410 --> 11:58.670
She's still sick in bed.
It's been a week now.

11:59.110 --> 12:01.740
Her fever's been stuck at
99.3º Fahrenheit.

12:02.620 --> 12:03.980
It won't go down, huh?

12:04.250 --> 12:07.310
Well, she's always been that way.

12:08.020 --> 12:10.420
The day before a school trip,

12:10.460 --> 12:13.090
before an art exhibit awards ceremony,

12:13.130 --> 12:15.190
the day of an art magazine interview...

12:16.100 --> 12:18.930
Well, I guess
it's similar to a teething fever.

12:19.870 --> 12:20.860
A teething fever...

12:21.400 --> 12:23.340
But this one's longer than expected...

12:24.110 --> 12:26.070
Did something happen to her?

12:26.240 --> 12:28.830
Well, she won't say anything.
I've no clue.

12:30.240 --> 12:33.110
Recently her work pace has slowed.

12:33.580 --> 12:37.880
Before, I couldn't keep up,
no matter how many canvasses I'd prepare.

12:39.220 --> 12:43.420
Hagu kind of hasn't been
herself lately.

12:43.860 --> 12:46.380
Yeah. What the heck happened to her?

12:47.630 --> 12:50.390
I can't do anything about it
if I don't know the cause of it.

12:52.030 --> 12:57.400
My princess kind of looked like
she'll just stay asleep for a 100 years.

12:58.110 --> 13:01.370
100 years...
That's like Sleeping Beauty.

13:02.540 --> 13:03.570
Sleeping Beauty, huh?

13:04.350 --> 13:05.780
Then she won't wake up
without that. huh?

13:05.950 --> 13:07.140
You know, a prince's...

13:07.310 --> 13:09.080
Yeah, a prince's ki...

13:09.320 --> 13:10.340
Ki...

13:11.450 --> 13:12.510
- Kiss?!
- Kiss?!

13:14.790 --> 13:16.280
S-Sensei?!

13:17.460 --> 13:20.590
Sensei, Sensei, I get it already.

13:20.860 --> 13:22.990
Put away the bat with
nails in it, okay?

13:23.300 --> 13:25.490
And that diagram is looping around...

13:29.670 --> 13:33.660
Hagu went out shopping
with Shinobu before, right?

13:33.810 --> 13:38.580
That day, she came back depressed.
She said to me...

13:39.510 --> 13:42.040
I-I didn't have fun.

13:42.950 --> 13:45.280
She said that she couldn't say
she wanted to go to the bathroom

13:45.320 --> 13:47.380
and couldn't eat with him
in front of her.

13:48.320 --> 13:49.520
So she said that she hated it...

13:51.730 --> 13:56.250
That fool.
It's obviously because she likes him.

14:01.900 --> 14:03.100
I hadn't realized it...

14:04.910 --> 14:07.430
I was simply glad.

14:08.340 --> 14:11.640
Glad that she would do
as she liked in front of me...

14:12.680 --> 14:16.380
Her filling her mouth with
tasty-looking pudding in front of me

14:16.420 --> 14:17.750
was really adorable.

14:19.550 --> 14:21.820
I feel like I have a lump in my throat

14:21.860 --> 14:23.790
and I have difficulty swallowing things
when we're together...

14:24.830 --> 14:27.590
If that feeling is love...

14:29.330 --> 14:34.730
then it was really... only me in love.

14:36.570 --> 14:37.630
Only me...

14:44.010 --> 14:47.780
What? Takumi. this is unusual.
You're early, today.

14:48.120 --> 14:50.850
Well... I'm early,
or how should I say it...

14:51.350 --> 14:54.120
I'm sorry. You aren't coming back
from an all-nighter in the morning.

14:54.260 --> 14:55.550
You came back in the evening, huh?

14:55.660 --> 14:56.680
Oh. man...

14:56.860 --> 14:58.950
I'm sleepy, but I'm hungry.

14:59.590 --> 15:02.790
Oh. but I wonder
if I should just sleep as is.

15:03.200 --> 15:05.560
But I haven't eaten since last night, so...

15:06.370 --> 15:07.360
Takumi...

15:07.500 --> 15:10.400
It's no good.
His judgment is seriously impaired.

15:10.700 --> 15:14.230
Oh, okay. I'll boil some water.
Hang on a minute.

15:15.380 --> 15:19.470
Oh. but...
Just eat one, okay?

15:22.920 --> 15:24.410
What? Who was that just now?

15:24.690 --> 15:27.180
Please enter the access number.

15:27.220 --> 15:28.210
Huh?!

15:29.490 --> 15:31.790
Please enter the keyword.

15:33.790 --> 15:36.350
Please enter your birthday.

15:37.800 --> 15:40.390
Shinobu's room that's known as
the black hole of this apartment building,

15:40.430 --> 15:42.930
and that nobody's been able
to see inside?!

15:44.000 --> 15:47.570
He's getting through
the quasi-Sci-Fi security with great skill.

15:48.810 --> 15:51.510
Password accepted.
Permitting access.

15:52.580 --> 15:53.570
Wow!

15:53.710 --> 15:55.550
Even though Shinobu
built it himself

15:55.580 --> 15:58.310
even he has trouble getting
access permission in a single try.

15:58.690 --> 16:00.450
I can't get in my room...

16:03.090 --> 16:05.720
Verifying vocal pattern.
Your name, please.

16:05.760 --> 16:06.750
It's me!

16:06.930 --> 16:08.020
"Me" is not understood.

16:08.060 --> 16:09.120
It's me. Kaoru!

16:09.730 --> 16:12.220
Kaoru... Who're you again?

16:12.270 --> 16:15.860
Don't mess with me. I'm in a hurry.
I'll smash you, you moron!

16:16.340 --> 16:19.640
Then Kaoru, please say
three tongue twisters of your choosing...

16:19.670 --> 16:21.070
Oh, he plowed right through!

16:27.610 --> 16:28.710
What the heck is this?

16:29.650 --> 16:30.640
Found it!

16:31.250 --> 16:32.240
A passport!

16:32.720 --> 16:33.710
Shinobu...

16:34.690 --> 16:38.120
Yamamoto! Guard this with your life
for the fifty minutes to Narita Airport.

16:38.160 --> 16:39.150
Roger!

16:41.530 --> 16:44.620
Hayashida, listen up.
Don't let that idiot out of your sight.

16:45.400 --> 16:47.960
We don't stand a chance if
he goes off and gets lost.

16:48.670 --> 16:51.190
Yamamoto just left with his passport.

16:51.810 --> 16:53.100
I'll also head over for the time being.

16:53.940 --> 16:56.030
Passport... Narita Airport...

16:59.980 --> 17:04.210
Wait! Where's Shinobu going?!
Why?!

17:04.950 --> 17:07.790
Why you ask?
He's got work in Los Angeles.

17:08.190 --> 17:12.520
Los Angeles... The United States?!
When's he coming back?!

17:12.630 --> 17:15.060
Who knows?
Maybe in around half a year.

17:15.500 --> 17:18.400
- Half a year?!
- Excuse me. I'm in a hurry.

17:23.170 --> 17:25.830
What's the deal getting
in my car without permission?

17:25.910 --> 17:27.900
I-I'm Shinobu's junior...

17:28.140 --> 17:32.810
No. I'm a friend!
I-I promised to see him off!

17:33.350 --> 17:34.870
Listen, you...

17:35.080 --> 17:36.520
I-I guess not?!

17:38.220 --> 17:39.280
Your seatbelt.

17:40.090 --> 17:44.720
Oh... Thank you... very much!

18:08.080 --> 18:10.070
We're stuck.
Is this as far as we go?

18:12.890 --> 18:16.520
What about the passport?
Did you make it in time? I see.

18:16.790 --> 18:19.590
No good on this end.
We're stuck at the inspection entrance.

18:19.990 --> 18:21.820
This was a waste of time.
I'm turning back.

18:22.830 --> 18:24.130
Oh.
Hey!

18:26.100 --> 18:27.500
I never got his name.

18:44.250 --> 18:46.050
You jerk!

18:47.250 --> 18:48.880
What're you thinking?!

18:50.090 --> 18:54.220
I don't get you at all.
You're always so selfish.

18:55.100 --> 18:56.720
You place everything I want

18:56.830 --> 19:00.770
in the palm of your hand
without closing it...

19:01.970 --> 19:06.740
You're going to lose her soon.
Don't you get it?!

19:19.120 --> 19:22.350
My wallet! That's right.
I was in such a rush.

19:22.390 --> 19:24.950
H-How am I supposed to get home?

19:25.230 --> 19:26.320
Have you finished seeing him off?

19:27.960 --> 19:29.330
W-Was he watching me?

19:29.530 --> 19:31.090
Uh. umm. I...

19:31.800 --> 19:33.700
Now then... I guess I'll head back.

19:34.800 --> 19:35.790
You want a ride, right?

19:36.770 --> 19:37.930
Thank you very much.

19:38.710 --> 19:41.400
I felt like I'd seen him
somewhere before.

19:41.940 --> 19:45.140
Looking closer,
he looks exactly like him

19:45.380 --> 19:46.400
U-Umm...

19:46.450 --> 19:48.880
By any chance,
are you Shinobu's older brother?

19:49.180 --> 19:50.310
What makes you think that?

19:50.750 --> 19:51.780
Your face looks a lot like his...

19:51.850 --> 19:55.790
How rude! Don't lump me together
with that tight-wad wild boy!

19:55.990 --> 19:58.620
I-I'm sorry. I was wrong, huh?

19:58.660 --> 20:00.060
No. I am his older brother.

20:00.290 --> 20:01.390
Oh. I knew it.

20:01.530 --> 20:03.430
If you take away
his talent for making money,

20:03.460 --> 20:05.020
he's nothing
but a primitive ape-man!

20:05.770 --> 20:07.360
There's no time.
so I'm going to speed up.

20:07.730 --> 20:09.670
Watch out for your neck.

20:15.380 --> 20:16.500
Okay, we're here.

20:18.480 --> 20:21.410
Uh, umm... Thank you very much...

20:21.820 --> 20:23.040
For one reason or another,

20:23.080 --> 20:25.570
he brought be back to
the apartment. He's a good guy.

20:25.790 --> 20:27.250
Oh, just a minute.

20:31.460 --> 20:33.520
That will be 47,200 yen.

20:33.790 --> 20:35.790
He's like him. after all!
Is it in their DNA?!

20:36.400 --> 20:39.730
I-I'm sorry...
for getting in without permission...

20:39.770 --> 20:41.670
and making you
bring me back here.

20:42.000 --> 20:45.100
But I don't have any money
with me... right now.

20:46.470 --> 20:47.770
It's a joke.

20:49.440 --> 20:51.740
Then, thank you very much for today.

20:52.110 --> 20:53.910
- Bye, Yuta.
- Huh?

20:54.450 --> 20:56.250
I leave Shinobu to you from here on.

20:56.720 --> 20:57.710
How?

20:57.880 --> 20:59.720
In Shinobu's "List of Friends."

20:59.750 --> 21:03.620
there was a "White-Collar Criminal Takumi."
and a "Shiba Inu Yuta."

21:08.760 --> 21:11.730
When will Shinobu Morita
be coming back?

21:11.900 --> 21:14.230
Who knows? I can't say for sure.

21:14.900 --> 21:16.890
But from the amount
of work he took on.

21:16.940 --> 21:19.240
he probably won't be able
to come back so easily.

21:20.510 --> 21:23.480
Do you want him to come back?
Do you not want him to come back?

21:30.820 --> 21:36.920
After rubbing closed eyes

21:37.660 --> 21:42.960
I can see the pastel future

21:43.060 --> 21:49.630
I follow scattered signs

21:49.970 --> 21:53.700
Wearing puzzled expressions

21:53.740 --> 21:59.510
Hey, what were we looking for?

21:59.610 --> 22:02.350
And when was it?

22:02.350 --> 22:02.380
Back when we met, despite our denial
And when was it?

22:02.380 --> 22:10.020
Back when we met, despite our denial

22:10.060 --> 22:16.220
It was like a waltz, so mysterious

22:16.300 --> 22:19.160
At an intersection,

22:19.200 --> 22:22.190
with sunlight shining through the trees

22:22.470 --> 22:25.530
As we turned in time together

22:25.570 --> 22:28.740
The two of us spinning around in a waltz

22:28.780 --> 22:31.840
It was like a waltz

22:31.880 --> 22:34.610
We continue our dance.

22:38.120 --> 22:38.950
Ayumi...

22:56.170 --> 22:59.700
Next time:
"That one thing was all I wanted to hear"
